## Stack Underflow
if stack is empty you are trying to do st.peek() st.pop() --> EmptyStackException


## Stack Overflow
if stack is full and you are trying to do st.push()  ---> StackOverFlowError
when occur
* Actual memory is full
* Implement using Arrays - sizes - fixed

