## Advantages of Array Implementation over linkedList
1. Size --> for every element -> space taken is one block
   but in linkedList two block

2. fixed size of stack

Disadvantages:
1. Size --> fixed --> overflow


## Advantages of linkedList Implementation over Array
1. Unlimited size

Disadvantages:
1- size --> two data members
2 display --> reverse --> space complexity


